OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be cloudy and mainly dry. Then
OL,7,Fthe rest of the night will remain
OL,8,Fcloudy with patchy rain or drizzle,
OL,9,Fmainly across the west.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FAfter a mostly dry morning
OL,12,Flight and patchy rain will spread
OL,13,Fsoutheast during the afternoon and
OL,14,Fevening.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FChance
OL,17,Fof some rain at first on Tuesday,
OL,18,Fotherwise dry and much brighter.
OL,19,FBright with scattered showers on
OL,20,FWednesday. Mostly dry on Thursday.
